    "sections": {
        "description": "Multi Purpose Business Theme is a flexible website theme with a structured layout for presenting business information and services. It includes customizable sections for content, banners, menus, service details, testimonials, and contact information. The design can be adapted through available customization settings, allowing changes to colors, typography, layouts, and other visual elements without modifying the core theme files. Responsive layouts help content adjust across desktop, tablet, and mobile screen sizes. Navigation menus provide a way to organize pages and important sections for easier site browsing. The Multi Purpose Business can also include widget-ready areas for adding supporting content such as recent posts, categories, or custom elements. Blog layouts support publishing articles, updates, and other written content. Image-based sections can be used to present projects, services, or featured information. Social media integration options may be available for connecting external profiles. The theme is suitable for creating structured websites that require a combination of informational pages, service sections, blog content, and contact details. Its multipurpose structure allows the same design framework to be configured for different types of website content and layouts."
    },
